---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '@/components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '@/config/site';
import { prettyPhone } from '@/lib/enquiry';
---

<Base title="Privacy" description="How Whizperz Tours & Safaris handles information on this website.">
  <PageHero title="Privacy policy." intro="Last updated 5 November 2026." />
  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p>This notice explains what happens to information on the {site.name} website. The website is run by {site.legalName}, trading as {site.name} (“we”), which is responsible for the information described here.</p>
      <h2>Enquiries</h2>
      <p>The enquiry form and route sketcher do not send or store anything on this website. They open WhatsApp or your email app with your message written out, and you choose whether to send it. Once you send it, we use your details only to reply and plan your trip.</p>
      <h2>Saved routes</h2>
      <p>The route sketcher remembers your route in your own browser so it’s still there when you come back. It never leaves your device unless you send it to us. Clearing your browser data removes it.</p>
      <h2>Other services</h2>
      <p>This site uses Google Translate for translation, Google Fonts for typefaces and Unsplash for some photography. Those services may process technical data such as your IP address under their own privacy terms.</p>
      <h2>Payments</h2>
      <p>Payments are made online when you book a journey, or through a private pay link we send you. M-Pesa payments are processed by Safaricom, card and mobile money payments by Pesapal, Paystack (a Stripe company), PayPal, iPOSpays (Dejavoo) or Unipesa, and crypto payments by NOWPayments, depending on the method you choose. We store your booking reference, the amount, the phone number an M-Pesa prompt was sent to, and the receipt or confirmation code, so we can match your payment to your booking. We never see or store your M-Pesa PIN or card details.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For privacy questions, contact us at <a class="link" href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a> or {prettyPhone(site.contact.phones[0] ?? '')}. Our office is in {site.contact.address} ({site.contact.postal}).</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
